  m_Name: ArcadeGameGorge
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 127
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Gorge
  Description: 'Jewel Wasps only - a timed feast on a reef. Shoals of prisms hang round the core. Sting
    a creature with a pull of RT, ride it to a shoal and hold RT: it sucks the prisms in.
    Space widens the pull, and at Space 5 it pulls from every side; every shield is food to
    a creature you ride. An omni crystal hatches a predator you ride at once. The most
    prisms taken off the board when the clock runs out wins. Higher intensities put the
    shoals farther out under a shielded crust, with more wild grazers racing you.'
